   "data": {
    "text": "TEXT & CAPTIONS\nPatch any CV (0 to 10 V) into a jack. 0 V is the item's From setting, 10 V its To.\n\nCV-CC 1: MIDI channel 9, CC 65 to 79\n   1 On-screen text\n   2 Captions\n   3 Text style\n   4 Stickers and emoji\n   5 Mood sticker on a face\n   6 End card\n   7 Chapter cards\n   8 suite: Comedy punch\n   9 suite: Reaction comedy\n  10 pair: When the picture freezes, a title appears\n  11 pair: When the joke pays off, a mood pops onto a face\n  12 pair: When someone gets angry, steam pops onto their face\n  13 pair: When an outro effect closes the film, an end card follows\n  14 pairs: Words that point\n  15 pairs: Phone comedy reactions"
   },
